    {
      "text": "Quadrant diagram of national context for eHealth development, with concentric circles and three numbered zones. Stages plotted from lower left to upper right: experimentation and early adoption (I), developing and building up (II), and scale up and mainstream (III). The image is cropped at its edges.",
